cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: excgrid
version: 0.2.0
authors:
  - family-names: Makowski
    given-names: Marcin
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/myamlak/excgrid"
abstract: >-
  A standalone grid + exchange-correlation kernel + dispersion library:
  molecular block-grid construction (Murray-Handy-Laming radial,
  Lebedev-Laikov angular, Becke/SSF partition) and the geometric
  derivatives of the grid points and their weights; a component table and
  schema naming what a kernel reads; and Yacas-code-generated LDA, GGA,
  hybrid and meta-GGA energy-density kernels with first derivatives and a
  second-derivative tier. D3 and D4 dispersion are included.
